        <Replace Tag="LOC_MAP_ANTARCTICA_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>A south polar map. Every civilization starts on the ice-free coast of Antarctica, a band four hexes deep around an icy interior of mountains, hills and plateau, with the rivers and lakes that run under the ice. Across the Southern Ocean lie the Distant Lands: South America, Southern Africa, Australia and New Zealand.</Text>
